---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Clear North: Aurora Alerts — Only When You Can See It"
  description="Clear North is an iPhone aurora alert app that only pings you when it is dark, clear, and the aurora is strong enough for your latitude."
>
  <div class="cn">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <span class="section-label">// clear north</span>
      <h1>Only When<br />You Can See It.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Most aurora alerts fire whenever the sun does something. Clear North waits until three things are true
        at your location, so a ping means the sky is actually worth stepping outside for.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <span class="btn btn-outline btn-lg btn-soon" aria-disabled="true">
          App Store <span class="soon-tag">Coming soon to the App Store</span>
        </span>
        <a href="/apps/clear-north/support/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Support</a>
        <a href="/apps/clear-north/privacy/" class="btn btn-outline">Privacy Policy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">// the rule</span>
        <h2>An alert fires only when all three hold</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="rule-grid">
        <div class="rule-card">
          <h3>Dark</h3>
          <p>It is astronomical darkness at your location, not just after sunset.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rule-card">
          <h3>Clear</h3>
          <p>Cloud cover is under 40%, from MET Norway forecasts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rule-card">
          <h3>Strong</h3>
          <p>The Kp index is high enough for your latitude (for example Kp 6+ at 45&deg;N), from NOAA SWPC.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">// features</span>
        <h2>Quiet by default, loud when it matters</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#127756;</div>
          <h3>Tonight</h3>
          <p>A plain verdict &mdash; Likely, Possible, or Unlikely &mdash; with the best viewing window and an hour-by-hour view.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128276;</div>
          <h3>Alerts you control</h3>
          <p>A nightly limit (default 2) and quiet hours keep it from nagging. An optional dusk heads-up tells you what the night looks like.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9889;</div>
          <h3>Wake me for major storms</h3>
          <p>Optional. Kp 7+ storms can be delivered as time-sensitive notifications, even during quiet hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128197;</div>
          <h3>Outlook</h3>
          <p>The next three nights, a rough 27-day guide, and a look at what the sun has been doing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128308;</div>
          <h3>Red night-vision mode</h3>
          <p>A red-only display that protects your dark-adapted eyes while you are out watching.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128274;</div>
          <h3>Coarse location only</h3>
          <p>The app rounds your position on your device to a large grid cell. Precise coordinates are never sent. No account, no ads, no tracking.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header pricing-header">
        <span class="section-label">// pricing</span>
        <h2>Check tonight free. Unlock the alerts.</h2>
        <p>Pricing will be shown in the App Store at launch.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <div class="pricing-card">
          <h3>Clear North Free</h3>
          <p class="price">Free</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Tonight&rsquo;s verdict</li>
            <li>Best window and hour-by-hour view</li>
            <li>Red night-vision mode</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-card pricing-card-premium">
          <h3>Clear North Pro</h3>
          <p class="price">Yearly or lifetime</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Aurora alerts</li>
            <li>3-night and 27-day outlook</li>
            <li>Multiple locations</li>
            <li>Yearly plan includes a 7-day free trial</li>
            <li>Or buy Pro once, for life</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container bottom-cta">
      <p>Clear North: Aurora Alerts is coming soon to the App Store.</p>
      <p class="credits">
        Cloud forecasts: <a href="https://api.met.no/">MET Norway</a> (licensed
        <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>).
        Geomagnetic data: <a href="https://www.swpc.noaa.gov/">NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center</a>.
        Clear North is an independent app and is not endorsed by MET Norway or NOAA.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .cn {
    --bg: #080b14;
    --surface: #10141f;
    --border: #232a3b;
    --text: #ece6d8;
    --text-muted: #b4aea0;
    --accent: #86e8b0;
    --accent-hover: #a8f0c6;
    --accent-dim: rgba(134, 232, 176, 0.1);
    --warning: #e0b060;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .cn h1, .cn h2 { font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 500; }
  .cn .btn-primary { color: #080b14; }
  .hero { padding: 6rem 0 5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .hero-content { max-width: 700px; }
  .hero h1 { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .hero-sub { font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 54ch; margin-bottom: 2rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-lg { padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem; font-size: 1rem; }
  .btn-soon { cursor: default; border-style: dashed; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .btn-soon:hover { border-color: var(--border); color: var(--text-muted); background: transparent; }
  .soon-tag { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--warning); border: 1px solid var(--warning); border-radius: 100px; padding: 0.1rem 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.15rem; }
  .rule-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .rule-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-top: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.5rem; }
  .rule-card h3 { font-family: 'Newsreader', Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .rule-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .features-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .feature-card { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.5rem; }
  .feature-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .feature-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .section-alt { background: var(--surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .pricing-header { text-align: center; }
  .pricing-header p { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .pricing-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .pricing-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.75rem; }
  .pricing-card-premium { border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-dim); }
  .pricing-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .price { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0.5rem 0 1.25rem; }
  .pricing-card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .pricing-card li { font-size: 0.875rem; padding: 0.35rem 0 0.35rem 1.25rem; position: relative; }
  .pricing-card li::before { content: '\2713'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .bottom-cta { text-align: center; }
  .bottom-cta p { font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .credits { font-size: 0.8rem !important; max-width: 60ch; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text-muted); }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero { padding: 3rem 0; }
    .features-grid, .pricing-grid, .rule-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
